# Minimum Tests (Required for MVP)

## Matching

- barcode → Variant (VariantBarcode)
- vendorCode → Variant
- Priorities
- Conflict when multiple variants share same barcode
- **externalRef normalization:** "007" / "7" / " 7 " → one key; "7.0", "-7", "7e3", "" → 400

## Origin Tracking

- On import from marketplace: do not overwrite master if `lastStockOrigin` already from that marketplace
- On push: avoid cycles (hash comparison, skip echo)
